{
  "text": "UI Audit Restaurant A\nRESTAURANT ADMIN\nAhmedabad Flagship Store\nAPP\nRestaurant Admin\nKiosk Admin\nWorkspace\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch · MAIN\nUI Audit Second Branch A · UIA2\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nTODAY\nToday\nOrders\nBilling / Invoices\nPayments & Split\nRegister shifts & cash\nKITCHEN\nKitchen progress\nKitchen tickets\nMENU\nMenu & Categories\nCustomisations & Tax\nOffers & Coupons\nInventory & Recipes\nPurchasing & Stock Control\nTABLES\nFloor / Tables\nReservations\nQR Table Ordering\nON\nGUESTS & TEAM\nCustomers & loyalty\nTeam & permissions\nREPORTS\nReports & Analytics\nActivity history\nDEVICES\nPrinters & Devices\nConnections & sync\nApp Downloads\nSETUP\nReceipt & E-Bill\nRestaurant Settings\nSubscription Plans\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nEOD Report\nReconciliation\nAssistant\nLog out\nCustomisations & Tax\n\nChoices guests can add to a dish (cheese, size, spice) and the tax each dish carries. Attach them to dishes in Menu & Categories.\n\nGuest menu\n\nGuests who scan a QR code see the menu you last published, never a half-finished edit. Live now: version 1.\n\nUp to date\nPublish to guests\nPreview what guests will see\n\n100 dishes would be shown to guests.\n\n100 dishes in 10 categories are live.\n\nCustomisation groups\nNew group\n\nNo customisation groups yet. Guests can only order dishes as they are.\n\nTax groups\nNew tax group\n\nNo tax groups. Dishes are sold without tax until you add one.\n\nJAMAN AI",
